    "{name}、あなたが選んだ道ですのね。わたくしを置いて、よくも。": "{name}, so this is the road you chose. To leave me behind — how dare you.",
    "{name}、すぐ戻るさ。……まあ、こういうのは積もるんだけどな": "{name} will be back before you know it. ...This sort of thing stacks up, though.",
    "{name}、すぐ戻るわよ。……まあ、こういうのは積もるんだけどね": "{name} will be back in no time. ...These things do pile up, mind you.",
    "{name}、なんか元気ないのよね最近。声かけてあげて": "{name} has been a bit flat lately. Go and say something to her.",
    "{name}、なんか元気ないんだよなあ最近。声かけといてやってくれよ": "{name} has been low lately, you know. Do me a favor and have a word with her.",
    "{name}、よう追い込んどるが。……その無理が、いつか祟らんことをねがうばかりだ": "{name} drives herself hard. ...I only pray that debt never comes due.",
    "{name}、よく追い込んでいる。……その借り、いつか返すことになる": "{name} pushes herself well. ...That is borrowed. It gets repaid.",
    "{name}、よく頑張ってるよ。……頑張りすぎてなきゃいいんだけどなあ": "{name} is giving it everything. ...I hope she isn't giving it too much.",
    "{name}、よく頑張ってるわ。……頑張りすぎてなきゃいいんだけどね": "{name} is working hard. ...I just hope she isn't working too hard.",
    "{name}、一週抜けばまた入るようになる。それだけの話だ": "Give {name} a week off and it starts going in again. That is all it is.",
    "{name}、乗ってるよ今。声かけたらもっと伸びるかもな": "{name} is riding high right now. Say something and she might climb higher.",
    "{name}、乗ってるわね今。声かけたらもっと伸びるかもよ": "{name} is on a roll right now. A word from you might push her further.",
    "{name}、今は体が持ってるよ。持ってるうちが花なんだよなあ、ああいうのは": "{name}'s body is holding out today. Holding out is the whole of it, with that.",
    "{name}、今は体が持ってるわ。持ってるうちが花なのよ、ああいうのは": "{name}'s body is holding up for now. That sort only holds while it holds.",
    "{name}、今日はよく動いてる。仕込むなら今だ": "{name} is moving well today. If you want to teach her something, now is the time.",
    "{name}、今日は体が重い。何をやらせても素通りだ": "{name} is heavy today. Whatever you give her passes straight through.",
    "{name}、今週は当たり週だ。使うなら、ここで使え": "This is {name}'s week. If you are going to use her, use her now.",
    "{name}、今週も同じ調子で行くなら、得は薄いぞ": "Run {name} the same way this week and you get very little from it.",
    "{name}、伸びる顔をしている。今日の一本は残るぞ": "{name} has the look of someone growing. Today's session will stick.",
    "{name}、動けてはいる。だが、切れがひとつ落ちている": "{name} can still move. The sharpness has dropped a notch, though.",
    "{name}、同じメニューなのに返りが薄い。そろそろ一息か": "Same program for {name}, and less comes back. Time to let her breathe?",
    "{name}、平熱だ。それでいい": "{name}. Running at a normal temperature. Good.",
    "{name}、平熱を保っている。それでいい": "{name} is holding a steady temperature. That will do.",
    "{name}、悪くはない。ただ、先週ほどは入っていかない": "{name} isn't bad. It just isn't going in like it did last week.",
    "{name}、最近いい顔して練習に来るのよ": "{name} has been coming in with a good face on lately.",
    "{name}、最近いい顔して練習に来るんだよなあ": "{name} comes into the gym with a good look on her face these days.",
    "{name}、汗はかいている。だが、身についてはいない": "{name} is sweating, all right. None of it is sticking.",
    "{name}、特に変わりもなく元気にやってるよ": "{name} is the same as ever, healthy and going strong.",
    "{name}、特に変わりもなく元気にやってるわよ": "{name} is the same as ever and doing fine.",
    "{name}、目が泳いでいる。注意しておいた方がいい": "{name}. Her eyes are wandering. Worth watching.",
    "{name}、目が泳いどる。様子を見ておけ": "{name}. Her eyes wander. Keep watch on her.",
    "{name}、目の光が違う。悪くない": "{name}. Different light in her eyes. Not bad.",
    "{name}、目の光が違うとる。いいぞ": "{name}. Different light in her eyes. Good.",
    "{name}、置いていくの? いいわ。次に向き合うときは、容赦しないから。": "Leaving me behind, {name}? Fine. Next time we face each other, I won't be gentle.",
    "{name}、足の踏ん張りが甘い。何かある": "{name}. Soft through the legs. Something is going on.",
    "{name}、足の踏ん張りが甘くなっている。何かある": "{name}. Her legs have gone soft under her. Something is behind it.",
    "{name}、軽い怪我だ。軽いうちは": "{name}. A light injury. While it is light.",
    "{name}、軽い怪我だ。軽いうちは、な": "{name}. A light injury. Light, for now.",
    "{name}、飯の食いっぷりが落ちてる。心配だねえ": "{name}'s appetite has dropped off. I don't like the look of that.",
    "{name}、飯の食いっぷりが落ちてるわ。心配ね": "{name} isn't eating the way she used to. That worries me.",
    "{name}ぁ、テメー筋通せって話だろ。次のリング、覚悟しとけよ。": "{name}, you could've done it straight, at least. Next ring, be ready.",
    "{name}が抜けた。受け止めるしかないけど、釈然としない。": "{name} is gone. Nothing to do but take it, and it still doesn't sit right.",
    "{name}さん、{stat}が伸び悩んでいます。本人も気づいているみたいです": "{name}'s {stat} has stalled. I think she has noticed it herself.",
    "{name}さん、{stat}が良くなってきています。焦らず続けましょう": "{name}'s {stat} is improving. Let's keep at it without rushing her.",
    "{name}さん、{stat}には十分な余地が残っています。焦らず育てましょう": "{name}'s {stat} has plenty of room left. We can grow it slowly.",
    "{name}さん、{stat}はこの先はゆっくりになると思います。それも成熟の証です": "{name}'s {stat} will come along more slowly from here. That is maturity, too.",
    "{name}さん、いつものペースでやっていますよ": "{name} is working at her usual pace.",
    "{name}さん、すぐ戻れます。……ただ、こういうものは積み重なりますからね": "{name} can return soon. ...Only, these things accumulate.",
