    "{name}さん、少し元気がないかもしれません。気にかけてあげてください": "{name} may be a little low just now. Please keep an eye on her.",
    "{name}さん、最近すごく前向きな顔をしていますよ": "{name} has had a wonderfully open face about her lately.",
    "{name}さん、練習中に何か考え込んでいる時間が増えました": "{name} spends more time lost in thought during practice now.",
    "{name}さん、自分でも手応えを感じ始めているみたいです": "{name} seems to be feeling it come together herself.",
    "{name}さん、落ち着いて過ごせているみたいです": "{name} seems to be settled and getting on well.",
    "{name}さんの{stat}、まだまだこれからですよ。楽しみです": "{name}'s {stat} is only beginning. I'm looking forward to it.",
    "{name}さんの{stat}、もう十分に高いところまで来ていますよ": "{name}'s {stat} has already come a very long way up.",
    "{name}さんの{stat}、少し足踏みしていますね。でも悪いことではありませんよ": "{name}'s {stat} is marking time a little. That isn't a bad thing at all.",
    "{name}さんの{stat}、着実に伸びてきていますよ。本人も気づいているはずです": "{name}'s {stat} is climbing steadily. She must be able to feel it.",
    "{name}さんの怪我、軽いものですけれど。……これが先々の問題にならなければいいのですが": "{name}'s injury is a small one. ...I hope it doesn't become a problem later.",
    "{name}にきついのを続けるか。…見極めどきだな": "Keep the hard work on {name}? ...This is the call to make.",
    "{name}の{stat}、ちょっと足踏みしてるなあ。まあこういう時期もあるさ": "{name}'s {stat} is stuck in one place a while. Happens to everybody sooner or later.",
    "{name}の{stat}、ちょっと足踏みしてるわね。まあこういう時期もあるわ": "{name}'s {stat} is treading water a bit. Everyone gets a stretch like that.",
    "{name}の{stat}、まだまだ伸びるよこれ。楽しみだねえ": "{name}'s {stat} has a lot of climbing left. Nice thing to think about.",
    "{name}の{stat}、まだまだ伸びるわよこれ。楽しみね": "{name}'s {stat} has a long way up left in it. Something to look forward to.",
    "{name}の{stat}、まだ底が見えない": "{name}'s {stat}. Still no bottom in sight.",
    "{name}の{stat}、まだ底が見えん。追い込めばもっと伸びる": "{name}'s {stat}. No bottom in sight yet. Drive her and she grows.",
    "{name}の{stat}、もうだいぶ頭打ち近いなあ。ここまで来たらたいしたもんだよ": "{name}'s {stat} is pretty near the top now. Getting here is something to be proud of.",
    "{name}の{stat}、もうだいぶ頭打ち近いわね。ここまで来たらたいしたものよ": "{name}'s {stat} is close to topping out. Getting this far is no small thing.",
    "{name}の{stat}、上がってきてるよ。あの子頑張ってるからなあ": "{name}'s {stat} is on the way up. That kid has been putting in the hours.",
    "{name}の{stat}、上がってきてるわよ。あの子頑張ってるものね": "{name}'s {stat} is coming up. She has been putting the work in.",
    "{name}の{stat}、壁にぶつかっている。ここからが本番": "{name}'s {stat} has run into a wall. The real test begins here.",
    "{name}の{stat}、壁にぶつかっとる。ここからが本番だ": "{name}'s {stat} has hit a wall. The real work starts here.",
    "{name}の{stat}、天井が見えている": "{name}'s {stat}. The ceiling is visible now.",
    "{name}の{stat}、天井が見えてきた。ここからは一厘の差だ": "{name}'s {stat}. The ceiling is in sight. From here it is inches.",
