    "{partner}さんっ…ごめんなさいっ…わたくしのせいでっ…！": "{partner}...! I am so sorry... it was all my fault...!",
    "{partner}さんっ…ごめんなさいっ…私のせいでっ…！": "{partner}...! I'm sorry... it was all my fault...!",
    "{partner}さんっ…！ ありがとうございます…二人で、勝てました…！": "{partner}...! Thank you... we won, the two of us...!",
    "{partner}さんっ…！ やりましたわ…二人で、勝ったのですわ…！": "{partner}...! We have done it... the two of us have won...!",
    "{partner}さんのおかげです。本当に、ありがとうございました。": "This is all thanks to you, {partner}. Truly, thank you.",
    "{partner}さんを信じておりまして、本当によかったですわ。": "I am so very glad that I placed my faith in you, {partner}.",
    "{partner}さんを信じてよかったです…ちゃんと、勝てました！": "I was right to believe in you, {partner}... and we really did win!",
    "{partner}さんを勝たせてあげられなくて…本当にすみません…！": "I couldn't give you the win, {partner}... I'm truly sorry...!",
    "{partner}さんを勝たせてさしあげられず…本当にごめんなさい…！": "I could not deliver the win to you, {partner}... I am truly sorry...!",
    "{partner}っ…ごめんっ…ごめんねっ…！": "{partner}...! I'm sorry... forgive me...!",
    "{partner}っ…ごめんっ…私のせいでっ…！": "{partner}...! Sorry... this was my doing...!",
    "{partner}っ…わりぃっ…あたしのせいでっ…！": "{partner}...! Sorry... this is all on me...!",
    "{partner}っ…！ ありがとう…二人で、勝ったよ…！": "{partner}...! Thank you... we won — the two of us...!",
    "{partner}っ…！ やったぜ…二人で、勝ったんだ…！": "{partner}...! We did it... the two of us took it...!",
    "{partner}っ…！ やったわ…二人で、勝ったのよ…！": "{partner}...! We did it... the two of us won...!",
    "{partner}となら…だ、大丈夫って…信じてた、の…": "With {partner}... I-I knew it would be all right... I believed that...",
    "{planType}が組まれた。両派閥の勢いが上がっている。": "{planType} was booked. Both factions have picked up momentum.",
    "{prevRank}位から{rank}位。上げ潮に乗った団体の勢いが、記録に刻まれた。": "From No. {prevRank} to No. {rank}. A promotion riding a rising tide, and the record now says so.",
    "{prevRank}位から{rank}位。数字は厳しい。この沈黙をどう終わらせるかは、これからの話だ。": "From No. {prevRank} to No. {rank}. The numbers are hard. How this quiet spell ends is a question for later.",
    "{rivalName}とはまだ決着がついていませんが……もう、いいのです。": " {rivalName} and I never reached a finish... but it is all right now.",
    "{rivalName}とはまだ決着がついておりませんが……もう、よろしいのです。": " Matters with {rivalName} remain unsettled... but that is quite all right.",
    "{rivalName}とはまだ決着がついてないけれど……もういいの。": " Things with {rivalName} are still unfinished... but I can let it go.",
    "{rivalName}とはまだ決着ついてねぇけど……もういい。": " Never settled it with {rivalName}... but whatever.",
    "{rivalName}とまだ決着ついてないけど……もういいです。": " I never settled things with {rivalName}, but... that's all right now.",
    "{targetName}の肩から、ようやく力が抜けた。": "The tension finally went out of {targetName}'s shoulders.",
    "{targetName}の表情が、わずかに緩んだ。": "Something in {targetName}'s face loosened a little.",
    "{targetName}は、ほっと息を吐いた。": "{targetName} let out a breath.",
    "{targetName}は、ロッカーの自分の席に、ようやく腰を下ろせた。": "{targetName} was finally able to sit down in her own spot in the locker room.",
    "{targetName}は、何も言わずに視線を落とした。": "{targetName} said nothing and dropped her eyes.",
    "{targetName}は、小さく唇を噛んだ。": "{targetName} bit down on her lip, just slightly.",
    "{targetName}は、小さく頷いた。": "{targetName} gave a small nod.",
    "{targetName}は、少しだけ顔を上げて、遠くの輪を見ていた。": "{targetName} lifted her head a little and watched the circle from a distance.",
    "{targetName}は、社長の方をちらりと見て、口元を緩めた。": "{targetName} glanced your way, and the set of her mouth eased.",
    "{targetName}は、視線を逸らした。": "{targetName} looked away.",
