    "{targetName}は、誰にも見られないように、ロッカーの隅で目を伏せた。": "{targetName} lowered her eyes in the corner of the locker room, where no one would see.",
    "{tenure_farewell}……ここでの時間は、忘れない。{rivalry}……さよなら": "...{tenure_farewell} My time here stays with me.{rivalry} Goodbye.",
    "{tenure_farewell}……ここでの時間は、忘れねえっす……。{rivalry}……さよなら……。": "...{tenure_farewell} I'm not forgetting my time here...{rivalry} See you around...",
    "{tenure_farewell}……ここでの時間は、忘れません……。{rivalry}……ごきげんよう……。": "...{tenure_farewell} I shall not forget the time I had here...{rivalry} Good day to you...",
    "{tenure_farewell}……ここでの時間は、忘れません……。{rivalry}……さようなら……。": "...{tenure_farewell} I'll never forget the time I had here...{rivalry} Goodbye...",
    "{tenure_farewell}……ここで過ごした時間は、忘れません……。{rivalry}……失礼いたします……。": "...{tenure_farewell} I will never forget the time I spent here...{rivalry} Please excuse me...",
    "{tenure_farewell}…ここでの時間は、忘れないよ。{rivalry}…じゃあ、さよなら。": "...{tenure_farewell} I won't forget my time here.{rivalry} Well then. Goodbye.",
    "{tenure}……落ちてるのは自覚してる。……で、どれだけ下がる": "...{tenure} I know I've slipped. ...So how far does it drop?",
    "{tenure}下がるのか。……ま、去年の私を見てりゃ、そういう話にもなるよな。": "...{tenure} So it drops. ...Well, watching me last year, that tracks.",
    "{tenure}数字は落ちた。自分から言わせてほしい。……下げるのが筋だ": "...{tenure} The numbers fell. Let me be the one to say it. ...Lowering it is right.",
    "{tenure}自分の身体は自分が一番よく観ているの。……今年は下げて。それが筋だと思うわ。": "...{tenure} No one watches my body as closely as I do. ...Lower it this year. That is only right.",
