    "…別に。何でもねーよ": "...Nothing. It's nothing.",
    "…別にアンタに言われなくても辞めるつもりだったよ": "...I was going to quit anyway. Didn't need you to tell me.",
    "…前と態度が違う。…私のせいだろうね": "...She treats me differently now. ...That'll be my doing.",
    "…前と違う…私のせい…かな…": "...Different than before... My fault... probably...",
    "…力が足りませんでした。…次までに詰めます": "...We weren't strong enough. ...I'll close the gap before the next one.",
    "…力になれるよう、精一杯やる": "...I give all I have to be of use.",
