    "…努力が足りなかった。一からやり直す": "...Not enough work went in. I rebuild from zero.",
    "…努力が足りなかったんだ。もう一度、一からやり直します": "...I just hadn't done enough. I'm going back to the beginning and doing it again.",
    "…効いた…けど": "...That landed. Not enough.",
    "…効いた…でも": "...That landed. Doesn't matter.",
    "…効く。でも、ここで沈むのは違う。": "...That works. But going down here isn't it.",
    "…効くね…でも": "...That works. And yet.",
    "…効くね。でも、あんたたちの前じゃ倒れないよ。": "...That works. But I don't go down in front of you people.",
    "…効くね。でも、ここで沈むのは違うかな。": "...That works. But going down here doesn't feel right.",
    "…効くね。でも、まだ立てるよ。ここでは終われない。": "...That works. But I can still stand. It doesn't end here.",
    "…効くね。でも、迎えてくれた側に顔向けできなくなる。まだ立つよ。": "...That works. But I couldn't face the people who took me in. So I'm up.",
