    "…引き留める、か。…まあ、悪くない判断だね": "...Keeping me on, then. ...Not a bad call, honestly.",
    "…引き留めるんだぁ。まぁ、悪くない判断かな": "...So you're keeping me. Well, that's probably the right call.",
    "…引けない": "...Can't back off.",
