    "…退かない": "...I'm not stepping aside.",
    "…退屈な場所じゃないといいんだけど": "...Hope this place isn't dull.",
    "…退屈な試合はしない。約束する": "...I do not give boring matches. That is a promise.",
    "…逃がさない": "...Not letting you go.",
    "…逃がさない、そっち頼むね": "...She's not getting away. Take that side, would you?",
    "…逃がさない、頼む": "...She's not getting out. Cover it.",
    "…逃がさないよ、ゆっくりね": "...I'm not letting you go. Slowly now.",
    "…逃がさないよ。ここで終わらせる": "...You're not getting away. It finishes here.",
